{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27349","headline":"太和公主还宫 · 李敬方","name":"太和公主还宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二纪烟尘外，凄凉转战归。\n胡笳悲蔡琰，汉使泣明妃。\n金殿更戎幄，青祛换毳衣。\n登车随伴仗，谒庙入中闱。\n汤沐疏封在，关山故梦非。\n笑看鸿北向，休咏鹊南飞。\n宫髻怜新样，庭柯想旧围。\n生还侍儿少，熟识内家稀。\n凤去楼扃夜，鸾孤匣掩辉。\n应怜禁园柳，相见倍依依。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李敬方","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27349.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27349","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}